{"id":"vod_sn_36206","vodId":"36206","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"幸腹涂鸦","name_cn":"幸腹涂鸦","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2003d626013a8c14de8f6ae2c9186a1d.jpg"},"summary":"町子凉（佐藤利奈 配音）的父母都在海外工作，相依为命的奶奶又不幸去世，小小年纪的凉不得不开始了独自一人的生活。没过多久，凉就发现，自己做饭的手艺竟然大不如从前，这让向奶奶保证勤练厨艺的她感到十分内疚。　　一次偶然中，凉结识了名叫森野麒麟（大龟明日香 配音）的少女，麒麟热爱画画，能够进入东京的美术学校就读是她最大的梦想。受一直以来都十分照顾自己的阿姨所托，每个礼拜六，麒麟都会来到凉家暂住，家里多了一个人，连饭都变得好吃起来，凉这才发现，原来自己的手艺并没有退步。之后，凉又结识了千金大小姐椎名（小松未可子 配音），家中的餐桌上又多了一员大将！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jPxdbFRX8m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yd76XNJrGP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C1hrUsBvPD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q6iFhgrexL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pKcz89kncP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZQUhkLPH741/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QNxa9an56g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KHicFEucDF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UVGr7uYAv11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gZ1MWU7Fz31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kpjut0GBt01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gNAJgf35Qd1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.614Z"}